{"id":"ciencia","lemma":"ciencia","pos":"noun","rank":1344,"glosses":["science","erudition, knowledge"],"ipa":"/ˈθjenθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ciencias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/57/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ciencia.wav","examples":[{"text":"La ciencia es divertida.","en":"Science is fun.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/821320"},{"text":"Me gustan las ciencias y las matemáticas.","en":"I like both science and math.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582388"},{"text":"Me interesa la ciencia.","en":"I'm interested in science.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567482"},{"text":"Están en el laboratorio de ciencias.","en":"They're in the science lab."},{"text":"No tiene nada de ciencia.","en":"There's nothing to it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459924"}]}